## Why This Is Asked
Tests understanding of ACID in MVCC, practical use of SERIALIZABLE, and safe concurrent transfers with FOR UPDATE and retry logic.

## Key Concepts
- ACID, MVCC, SERIALIZABLE
- SELECT ... FOR UPDATE
- Serialization failure (SQLSTATE 40001) and retry
- Edge cases: insufficient funds, same-account transfers

## Code Example
```sql
-- pseudo-sql for clarity
BEGIN;
SELECT balance INTO from_bal FROM accounts WHERE id = :from FOR UPDATE;
SELECT balance INTO to_bal FROM accounts WHERE id = :to FOR UPDATE;
IF from_bal >= :amount THEN
  UPDATE accounts SET balance = from_bal - :amount WHERE id = :from;
  UPDATE accounts SET balance = to_bal + :amount WHERE id = :to;
  COMMIT;
ELSE
  ROLLBACK;
END IF;
```

